---
// Premium Principal Section with animated border, tilt card, and parallax
---

<section class="py-32 relative overflow-hidden bg-white dark:bg-gray-950">
    <!-- Background decorative -->
    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-1/2 h-full bg-gradient-to-l from-primary-500/[0.03] to-transparent -skew-x-12 translate-x-1/4 -z-10"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-96 h-96 bg-secondary-500/5 rounded-full blur-[120px] -z-10"></div>

    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-20 items-center">
            <!-- Image Side with animated gradient border -->
            <div class="reveal reveal-left">
                <div class="relative group">
                    <!-- Animated gradient border wrapper -->
                    <div class="absolute -inset-1 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-400 via-secondary-500 to-accent-400 rounded-[3rem] opacity-30 group-hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-700 blur-sm"></div>
                    <div class="absolute -inset-1 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-400 via-secondary-500 to-accent-400 rounded-[3rem] opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700 animate-gradient-shift" style="background-size: 200% 200%;"></div>

                    <div class="relative aspect-[4/5] rounded-[3rem] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl z-10">
                        <img
                            src="/principal.png"
                            alt="Mr. Arif Hidayat, M.Pd. - Kepala Sekolah SMP ABBS Surakarta"
                            class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700"
                        />
                    </div>

                    <!-- Floating stat card -->
                    <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -right-6 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-2xl border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 z-20 animate-float-slow">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-400 to-accent-500 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center">
                                <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <div class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Akreditasi</div>
                                <div class="text-xl font-black text-gray-900 dark:text-white">A</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Decorative corner accent -->
                    <div class="absolute -top-4 -left-4 w-24 h-24 border-t-4 border-l-4 border-primary-500/30 rounded-tl-[3rem] -z-0 group-hover:border-primary-500/60 transition-colors duration-500"></div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Content Side -->
            <div class="reveal reveal-right">
                <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-primary-50 to-primary-100/50 dark:from-primary-900/20 dark:to-primary-900/10 text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-8 border border-primary-200/50 dark:border-primary-800/30">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z" /></svg>
                    Sambutan Kepala Sekolah
                </div>

                <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-8 tracking-tight leading-[1.1]">
                    Pendidikan Berkualitas untuk
                    <span class="text-gradient">Masa Depan Siswa.</span>
                </h2>

                <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 text-lg font-light leading-relaxed">
                    <p>
                        SMP ABBS Surakarta berkomitmen menyediakan lingkungan belajar yang kondusif bagi pengembangan akademik dan karakter siswa. Kami memadukan kurikulum nasional dengan pendidikan nilai-nilai Islami untuk membentuk pribadi yang berintegritas.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Kami mengundang Anda untuk mengenal lebih dekat program-program unggulan kami yang dirancang untuk membekali siswa dengan kemampuan berpikir kritis, keterampilan bahasa, dan kesiapan menghadapi tantangan global.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-12 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-8">
                    <div class="flex flex-col border-l-2 border-primary-500 pl-4">
                        <span class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 dark:text-white leading-none">Mr. Arif Hidayat, M.Pd.</span>
                        <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2 font-medium">Kepala Sekolah</span>
                    </div>
                    <a href="/tentang" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800/50 hover:bg-primary-50 dark:hover:bg-primary-900/20 text-sm font-bold text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400 transition-all duration-300 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 hover:border-primary-200 dark:hover:border-primary-800">
                        Profil Sekolah
                        <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform duration-300" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6" /></svg>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
